---
description: CMake modules and GitHub reusable workflows
globs:
  - cmake/**
  - CMakeLists.txt
  - CMakePresets.json
  - fetchcontent-lockfile.json
  - .github/workflows/**
  - .github/zizmor.yml
---

Follow [AGENTS.md](../../AGENTS.md).

When editing these paths:

- CMake: gersemi via pre-commit; public options/functions use `MB_DEVENV_` prefix where applicable.
- Bump `fetchcontent-lockfile.json` only when intentionally updating FetchContent pins; re-run `cmake --workflow --preset dev`.
- Workflows: run `actionlint -color` before done; match existing action pinning and `permissions:` blocks.
- `pull_request_target` in pre-commit workflows is intentional — do not weaken to `pull_request` without a documented security review.
